WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
19:10 — Commute breath. On the U-Bahn Tom runs a short physiological sigh on his phone between stations — meetings still echoing, scroll hole deferred.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
21:00 — Sofa tablet. On the sofa the iPad opens Calm tools without autoplay noise; he picks one reset and leaves the rest alone.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
22:15 — Laptop reflection. Three lines of reflection on the laptop, then the lid closes. The day is allowed to stop.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
22:45 — Phone away. Last phone check confirms help is listed, then Do Not Disturb. Berlin can wait until morning.

